  "bodyHash": "e36c78f519f76bb5",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_45525595-d7b6-4c0a-88c5-a4bd635a0efc.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"169\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>JCRAFT: 末影之眼</strong> 是一款以《<em>JOJO的奇妙冒险</em>》为主题的 Minecraft 模组，支持<strong>Forge</strong>和&nbsp;<strong>Fabric 1.20.1</strong>。专注于为游戏增添源自《<em><strong>JOJO</strong></em>》世界的深度战斗与机制！由<strong>荒木飞吕彦</strong>创作的《JOJO的奇妙冒险》是一部影响深远、充满梗与文化致敬的杰出作品。<strong>JCRAFT</strong> 致力于向这段悠久而辉煌的历史致敬！&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_6a8be356-5564-4b5a-b5f3-bbaddf5113a4.png\" width=\"307\" height=\"81\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>问：</strong><em>我如何获得替身？</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>答：</strong>你需要寻找/制作/获取箭矢并右键点击。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>问：</strong><em>我如何查看我的替身能力？</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>答：</strong>输入 /stand about</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>问：</strong><em>目前游戏中有多少种替身类型（Spec）？</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>答：</strong>目前有 Brawler（通过制作拳击手套获得）、Anubis（通过制作阿努比斯获得）以及 VAMPIRISM（佩戴石鬼面受伤时获得）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>问：</strong>我如何查看我的替身招式（Spec Moves）？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>答：</strong>/spec about</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>问：</strong>我在哪里可以找到替身的 BB 模型？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>答：</strong>你可以在 GitHub 的 \"models\" 目录中找到它们。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>问：</strong><em>如何脱离连击（Combo）？</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>答：</strong>使用连击破招（蹲下 + 跳跃）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>问：</strong><em>该模组的依赖项有哪些？</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>答：</strong>Fabric 端：Architectury API 和 Fabric API</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>答：</strong>Forge 端：Architectury API、Azurelib、Cloth Config、Player Animator 和 Terrablender</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_ee9a16e4-9764-4d74-b2ab-c8c48a72ddd4.png\" width=\"443\" height=\"117\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_351e8be5-a61a-44c8-b2a5-fb78a2025bdd.png\" width=\"579\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong>白金之星</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_83dcf2ba-d090-461b-8e61-837022ece64a.png\" width=\"277\" height=\"514\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>暗影世界</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_cde11596-3b23-4caa-bfaa-8e49608a582e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"258\" height=\"470\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>世界</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_72e31bc1-44d7-488d-acdc-7d8275123dbf.png\" width=\"342\" height=\"414\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>魔术师之红</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_f6abef59-494d-46be-84d1-3585d1a0fca9.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"421\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>银色战车</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_be708bf5-cbcc-4f97-a0e7-baf3c9696c2b.png\" width=\"275\" height=\"423\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>绿色法皇</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_d58156ce-5eaa-4b0d-853b-195871801bc2.png\" width=\"271\" height=\"456\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>奶油</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_663e1df6-f5db-41df-b405-92765275fa19.png\" width=\"291\" height=\"446\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>愚者</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_9f1a7690-0218-4ac6-ac0f-993aca58792b.png\" width=\"406\" height=\"349\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>荷鲁斯</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_20c6a432-1cde-4cfc-a867-21686f214137.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"397\" height=\"518\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>太阳</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_f0191d22-6946-40de-95ff-a70711026e5b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"458\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_e9398185-e191-4d00-aaa3-ee4849f09573.png\" width=\"579\" height=\"95\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>杀手皇后</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_0e5bf7f0-c5e5-4cf9-83ea-277a2b99e9a8.png\" width=\"299\" height=\"509\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>手</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_43d9d7f9-5e85-41ed-9c5e-06d513b0994d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"322\" height=\"568\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>白金之星·世界</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_b1838759-8bd3-4b8a-b7da-3d37f6d6df87.png\" width=\"325\" height=\"514\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>杀手皇后：败者食尘</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_98992576-f73b-4b7c-a689-00008810b187.png\" width=\"308\" height=\"639\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_03aa4be1-f227-46d4-a8da-f9bbfbc0a478.png\" width=\"359\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>黄金体验</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_2e7c7209-4792-4dc9-abc1-8937f4b035cb.png\" width=\"234\" height=\"417\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>黄金体验镇魂曲</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_6efce2fe-2fe9-4600-b93e-de6524b142ac.png\" width=\"255\" height=\"462\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>绯红之王</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_09be3320-7c46-4aa3-8781-d04aa5e2e261.png\" width=\"303\" height=\"428\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>紫烟 / 紫烟·扭曲</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/47D0MOI\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_fce7a65d-af2c-47f0-85ba-428902866a88.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"281\" height=\"479\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong>金属制品</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/47D0MOI\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_d768c422-57a4-4373-89d1-3ecfa4911529.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"299\" height=\"453\"></strong></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_615cd83c-8663-4332-8b48-09141bbd1560.png\" width=\"360\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>白蛇</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_af7c8b1b-ddab-41e1-a5d3-3d6dfaff1f93.png\" width=\"276\" height=\"455\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>C-Moon（月面）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_a5e26286-d7f2-43fa-9575-bdfdf5dbc84d.png\" width=\"282\" height=\"512\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>天堂制造</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_903188af-862c-444d-a38f-c7454ac2c5ac.png\" width=\"299\" height=\"578\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_8720eabb-47e1-49a0-b234-742df3002e41.png\" width=\"360\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>D4C（Dirty Deeds Done Dirt Cheap）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_f478eab6-c60a-4707-8975-55068a6cffbe.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"560\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Mandom（暴君）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_dd6fceac-3a86-41ba-8166-8508a2601ff7.png\" width=\"284\" height=\"213\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_ea5e408a-1bd3-498c-becb-c31cbc314124.png\" width=\"360\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>天堂世界</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_e496f4b5-eb2e-4f58-ba5e-590688e8afe1.png\" width=\"313\" height=\"443\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_d21938f2-39b9-41cb-9b24-8e395d034fc1.png\" width=\"326\" height=\"86\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/mFRbQmqrmc\" rel=\"nofollow\">欢迎加入我们的 Discord！</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.jcraft-eoe.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">我们的 Wiki 是学习该模组的绝佳资料库！</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5IiQrGXN2xtNRWPQVUDbLQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube 频道</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/854974/description_d2cef22e-6285-4a44-ab0e-d25214c6e346.png\" width=\"398\" height=\"105\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>开发负责人</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Arna</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>项目经理</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">ccavet</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>开发者</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">PlanetTeamSpeak, MrSterner, Ayutac</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>美术总监：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">MrGarlic, Arna</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>美术：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Burrito, IvanTG, Sleeky, Vaye, Truflie, 和 Bagwet</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>平衡性调整：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Kai, Arna</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>音效：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Record</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>特别感谢：<br></strong>粘兽 提供模型、动画与指导！<br><strong>你可以找到他们的项目；<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f15735362%253fspm_id_from%253d333.337.0.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://space.bilibili.com/15735362?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">特别感谢一路上帮助过我们的所有人！<br><br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
